1385
01:55:28,416 --> 01:55:30,083
<i>Oxygen level critical.</i>

1386
01:55:31,291 --> 01:55:32,833
<i>- Oxygen level critical.
- </i>

1387
01:55:34,916 --> 01:55:36,625
<i>- 3 minutes.
- </i>

1388
01:55:41,083 --> 01:55:42,500
